# ============================================================
# WHITELIST: mac dinh BO QUA tat ca, chi track thu can len GitHub
# ============================================================
*

# --- bsc/ : toan bo Stage 1 (bone-surface coordinate), BIET LAP voi phan con lai ---
!bsc/
!bsc/**/
!bsc/**/*.py
!bsc/**/*.ipynb
!bsc/**/*.json
!bsc/**/*.md
!bsc/**/*.txt

# --- Report / ke hoach o goc ---
!*.md
!.gitignore

# --- Notebook cu (legacy, khong sua): giu de tham chieu ket qua baseline ---
!convert_*.ipynb
!merge_s*.ipynb

# --- Luon loai, ke ca khi khop rule tren ---
# Moi artifact (data, checkpoint, ray DB, ket qua chay) song tren Drive:
#   /content/drive/MyDrive/bsc/     -- KHONG BAO GIO ghi vao /content/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
*.zip
*.pth
*.pt
*.npz
*.npy
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.mat
*.h5
*.html
*.docx

# Secrets: token lay tu Colab Secrets (userdata.get), khong bao gio hardcode
.env
*.secret
secrets.json
credentials.json
